PLAYING FIELD.

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:12.922
PRESIDENT TRUMP IS IN HIS HEART

00:08:11.654 --> 00:08:14.290
A LEVEL PLAYING FIELD GUY.

00:08:13.056 --> 00:08:17.160
HE'S A FREE TRADE GUY.

00:08:14.424 --> 00:08:18.795
LET'S CLEAR AWAY -- THE WHOLE

00:08:17.293 --> 00:08:19.863
WORLD TRADING SYSTEM, BY THE

00:08:18.928 --> 00:08:21.131
WAY, HAS BEEN BROKEN FOR YEARS

00:08:19.996 --> 00:08:23.199
AND NEEDS TO BE FIXED.

00:08:21.264 --> 00:08:25.135
A LOT OF PRESIDENTS HAVE GONE

00:08:23.333 --> 00:08:25.935
DOWN THIS ROAD AND HAVE NEVER

00:08:25.268 --> 00:08:27.604
DONE ANYTHING.

00:08:26.069 --> 00:08:28.037
HE'S GONE DOWN THIS ROAD AND

00:08:27.737 --> 00:08:30.173
WON'T STOP.

00:08:28.171 --> 00:08:32.008
&gt;&gt; Laura: 1990'S CHINA ECONOMY

00:08:30.306 --> 00:08:33.209
IS SMALL AS THE SIZE OF ITALY.

00:08:32.142 --> 00:08:36.413
NOW I BELIEVE IT'S TEN TIMES THE

00:08:33.343 --> 00:08:37.280
SIZE OF CANADA.

00:08:36.546 --> 00:08:40.483
JAPAN, EXCUSE ME.

00:08:37.414 --> 00:08:42.118
&gt;&gt; FAIR TRADING, AND FREE MARKET

00:08:40.617 --> 00:08:42.452
CAPITALISM WILL BEAT THE

00:08:42.252 --> 00:08:43.186
CHINESE.

00:08:42.585 --> 00:08:46.423
I GIVE THE PRESIDENT A LOT OF

00:08:43.319 --> 00:08:49.659
HIGH MARKS FOR STICKING TO IT.

00:08:46.556 --> 00:08:52.162
AND HE IS NOT GOING TO LET GO.

00:08:49.793 --> 00:08:54.364
FOLKS, LISTEN TO HIM AND COME --

00:08:52.295 --> 00:08:56.099
WE'RE IN A FAMILY SQUABBLE WITH

00:08:54.497 --> 00:08:58.401
OUR ALLIES IN EUROPE.

00:08:56.232 --> 00:08:58.735
&gt;&gt; Laura: JAPAN COULDN'T KEEP

00:08:58.535 --> 00:09:00.503
GOING.

00:08:58.868 --> 00:09:02.272
&gt;&gt; WE'LL HAVE PLENTY OF TALKS.

00:09:00.637 --> 00:09:03.339
THEY'VE GOT TO DO THEIR PART.

